      "name": "Trinity Star",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "arcane"
      ],
      "text": "When Dream Aethusa dies, a field of iridescent energy envelops her lifeless body (and her gear) for 10 minutes. During this time, any creature that touches Dream Aethusa's body takes 9d6 force damage (DC 37 basic Reflex save save). After 10 minutes have passed, Aethusa's body rises into the air and is consumed by mythic energy, transforming into the Trinity Star hazard."
    },
